    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## For: Financial services, healthcare, insurance, energy — any regulated industry\n\n**The Problem:** Compliance teams in regulated industries spend enormous time monitoring regulatory changes across multiple bodies (SEC, FINRA, CMS, OSHA, state regulators), then manually assessing which internal policies, procedures, and controls are impacted. By the time the assessment is done, the next change has dropped. Organizations are evaluating vertical AI agents specifically designed for regulated industries, basing their decisions on productivity, not flashiness. ",
